WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.160
After the last battle with the combat cyborgs,

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.320
we haven’t been sent out
on any more emergency deployments for some reason.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:16.780
Along with Ginny who transferred to Riot Force 6,
we’ve been training, training and training some more.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:21.780
Vivio’s started to smile a lot,
and Nanoha seems somewhat happy as well.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:27.000
The forward team and
the lieutenants are also doing really well.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.090
I kind of feel like we’ll be invincible no matter what comes at us.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.100
So, Dad, we’re doing fine.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.720
I’ll write you again.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.040
Love, Subaru.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.600
So, tomorrow the Public Policy Convention finally begins.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:48.020
The area’s already been locked down in preparation for the Convention at 1400 hours tomorrow.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.120
Captain Nanoha and Lieutenant Vita,

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.360
along with Command Sergeant Major Rein
and the four forwards, will be heading out now.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.020
They’ll start guard on a night shift.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.990
Everyone, have you rested up well?

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.160
Yes, ma’am!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:07.440
Captain Fate, Lt. Signum, and I shall step in early in the morning.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.860
Until then, I’ll leave it up to you.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:10.940
Yes, ma’am.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.800
Oh, Marie’s coming as well?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.870
I’m doing something else.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.760
I have a bit of business in the central region.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.140
Eh? Vivio, what’s wrong?

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.650
It’s dangerous here.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:40.070
Sorry, Captain Nanoha, she said she wanted to see you off no matter what.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.920
You can’t do that, Vivio.
Dragging Aina out here was very selfish of you.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.220
I’m sorry.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.620
Nanoha, it’s her first time seeing you go out on night shift. I’m sure she’s nervous.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.760
Oh, I see.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:04:00.510
Mama Nanoha will be staying out tonight, but I’ll be back tomorrow night for sure.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.430
You will?

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.590
I definitely will.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:10.480
If you wait like a good girl, Vivio,
I’ll make you the caramel milk you like.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.420
Promise Mama, okay?

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:33.690
Well, let’s go back, Vivio.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.990
We’re also departing in nine hours.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.590
Let’s clean up what we were working on and hurry to bed.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:45.110
Yes, I’ll give the orders to the unit on shift.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.720
If you would.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:51.700
Even so, Vivio’s become really attached to you.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:52.480
Honestly.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.140
You’re right.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.060
I’ve tried to be pretty strict with her, but...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.730
I’m sure she understands that you’re really nice, Nanoha.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:06.860
Well, you might as well officially accept her as your child, Nanoha.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:11.110
We’re still looking for a household who will take her in.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:16.470
If we find a nice place,
and Vivio is all right with going there...

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:18.160
I have a feeling she won’t be.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:18.750
Ditto.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:26.020
Well, I’d be happy if I was with her forever,

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:29.300
but if we <i>do</i> find a good place for her, I’ll convince her.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.530
She’s a good girl, after all.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.160
Because I want her to be happy.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.620
Well... um...

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:45.370
Until we find a home for her, I’ll continue to protect her and be her guardian.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.110
And that’s definitely for sure.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.530
You’re right.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.550
Yes.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.200
And we’re done.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.550
Huh?

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.080
It’s my mom.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.310
Hi! Have you been doing well?

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.200
Yes. Good evening, Mom.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.470
Vivio, you too, good evening!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:10.670
Good evening!

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.390
Is something going on?

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:18.560
About the Convention tomorrow,
I was wondering if I should show my face.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:22.040
Oh, I think it’ll be okay.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.640
Chrono is in the middle of another mission.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.740
Others from the Main Office won’t really be there.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:34.660
Well, you see, I’d like to see my daughter’s face again, and I’d like to meet Vivio.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:40.820
You know, Mom, I’ll be on security detail,
and Vivio will be at the dorms.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.790
Oh, I see. You’re right.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.200
We haven’t been able to see
each other for a while, so it’s been lonely.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.320
You’ll be all right.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.980
Mama Lindy is Mama Fate’s mama.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:04.160
This mama is also Mama Fate’s mama.

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:05.060
That’s right.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:10.280
In the Testarossa family,
there’s my mother Presea and my big sister Alicia.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:14.950
In the Harlaown family, there’s my mother Lindy,
my big brother Chrono, and all the rest.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:22.350
Presea gave life to me,
and Lindy is still raising me even now.

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.500
I’m sorry, that was confusing, wasn’t it?

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:33.430
In other words, I have two mothers.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.720
Just like me?

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.680
Yep, just like you.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.340
Oh, what’s up?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:17.010
I got some tea from the other security forces,
so I thought I’d bring you some.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.680
Oh, how nice, thanks.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.100
Here you go.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:23.270
How’s everyone else doing?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.590
They’re at the far end of the security line.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.690
They’re just relaxing, taking turns in shifts.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.840
Can I stand here with you?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:30.400
Go ahead.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:35.540
I think this might have been a bit rude, but...

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.550
I looked into you a bit, Sgt. Vice.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:42.500
You were supposedly an ace-tier mage some years back.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:49.670
What? An ace?
My mana values were only half yours.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:55.130
Even so, you were an expert at
outrange shooting, an outstanding sniper.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:01.880
The past is the past. I’m Riot Force 6’s helicopter pilot now.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.980
It’s not a story which will be of any use to you.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:11.410
Besides, now is not the time to
be thinking about worthless stuff.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:15.490
If you space out, you’ll screw up
another shot and start crying about it, idiot.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:21.950
I’m sorry. I’ll be careful.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.330
If you understand, that’s fine. Go.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.090
I’m going.

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:38.010
It’s an old story. Isn’t that right, Storm Raider?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.810
In any event, it’s time for me to head inside.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:46.700
Yes, ma’am.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:51.190
And it seems while we’re guarding the inside,
we can’t bring our Devices.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.770
So Subaru, can I leave Raising Heart to you?

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.540
Y-Yes, ma’am!

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:01.490
The rest of you front-line troops should hang on
to the Devices for the rest of the officers.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.900
Yes, ma’am!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:20.590
There’s only three hours left until
the Public Policy Convention begins.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.490
The purpose of this convention is the exchange of ideas

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.320
in regards to the management of
the Bureau on Midchilda’s surface

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.620
between representatives for the HQ and the Main Office, as well as other worlds.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:34.290
And many people will be paying close attention to the announcements by Surface HQ,

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.780
which is a frequent subject of heated controversy.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:41.700
In particular, there has long been dispute over
the use of the G.A.S.’s Defense Interception System,

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:46.660
Einherjar, and it is believed that this issue will be discussed.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:53.060
Until the Convention starts, we will continue with our live feed, as well as updates on the situation.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.080
Oh, it’s started, hasn’t it?

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:10.830
Yeah.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.290
At this point, it doesn’t seem like anything’s going to happen.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.380
Don’t let your guard down.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:22.660
Do your job and keep watch.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.820
Yes, ma’am!

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.060
Even so...

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.300
I don’t really get it.

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:34.320
If things happen according to the prophecy, the chances of an internal coup d’état<i> are low.</i>

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.210
It’s not possible based on the data Inspector Acous acquired for us.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.630
So, then, it’ll be external terrorism.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.090
If so, what are they after?

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:50.820
The culprit before was that loser
who was collecting the Relics, Scaglietti, right?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:51.420
Yeah.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.940
If it’s the same dude and his crew this time,
we definitely don’t know what they’re after.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.900
Just how do they benefit by attacking this base?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:03.320
If he’s a weapon developer,
he might want to prove the might of his creations.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:12.300
If he can prove that he has the firepower or weaponry to destroy the HQ, there are many that would want such a thing.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:16.600
But if he wants to prove his power,
then there are many other places where he could do it.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.300
This would be too risky.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.960
You’re right.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.380
So I have no clue.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:26.330
Well, there’s no use thinking about it too much.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:29.560
We are given orders from superiors we trust.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.480
Let’s just follow that.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.440
Sounds good.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.860
It’s been a little over fours hours since it’s started.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.940
It should almost be over inside.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.610
Let’s do our best until the end!

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.790
Right!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.390
Where did Ginga go?

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:03.630
She went to the north entrance to give a report.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:08.600
I don’t feel so great relying on the others.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.800
Even so, it’s a valuable opportunity.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:16.010
If we’re able to clean everything up today,
that would be for the best.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.520
I guess.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.290
Actually, I’m worried about Lulu.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.250
I wonder if she’ll be okay.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.140
If you’re worried about Lutecia, then you can just go to her.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:29.410
But this time, I’m concerned about you, sir!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:33.870
Lulu still has her bugs and Galue with her,
but you’re alone, sir.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.600
Your target is this beardo, right, sir?

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.540
I’m just going to follow until then.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.860
I’ll protect you, sir.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.160
It’s up to you.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:47.120
Do as you wish.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.460
And I will.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.580
You <i>are</i> my savior, after all, sir.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:14:00.190
The Numbers from Number III, Tre,
to Number XII, Deed, are all in position.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.900
The young lady and Zest are in position as well.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.420
All preparations for attack are complete.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.860
Only thing that’s left is to wait for the signal.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:09.860
Yes.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.650
Seems like you’re having fun.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.040
I am.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:24.550
It’s the moment I change
this planet’s history with these hands.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:29.970
As a researcher and engineer,
it’s obvious I’d be overflowing with joy.

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:32.890
Isn’t that right, Uno?

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:37.130
We’ll show something special to our sponsor.

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:41.880
The result of our feelings, research, and development.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.530
Well, let us begin!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.370
Yes, sir.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:50.590
Mission start!

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:54.990
Asclepius, release limiter.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.620
An energy signature?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.040
What? That can’t be right.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.340
There’s an abnormality in
the communication control system.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:06.300
It’s being hacked? Someone’s breaking in!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.970
This can’t be!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:14.140
Quattro’s I.S.: Silver Curtain.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:17.450
Lies and illusions woven from electricity.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.600
Enjoy the play on my silver screen!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.100
It’s not just our transmitter?

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.520
There’s something wrong with the transmission system itself!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.850
Deploy the emergency defenses!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.190
Hurry and start up the backup search system!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.140
To think that they would really target HQ!

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:00.600
Execute I.S.: Rumble Detonator

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.980
Output power of the defensive barrier is falling.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.180
Miss Lu, if you please.

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.080
Initiating remote summon.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.500
I.S.: Heavy Barrel

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:32.340
<b>Barret Image: Aerosol Shell</b>

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:36.640
Fire!

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:46.650
Evacuate! Evacuate! Evacuate!

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:49.570
What’s going on?

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.270
We’re taking fire.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:52.890
We won’t stop the Convention.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.890
Take action as quickly as possible.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:55.490
Sir!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.130
Surface HQ’s defenses are perfect.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:01.410
There isn’t anyone who can get past them.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:07.790
There’s no real need to get all the way inside
if we just surround you and keep you powerless.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.730
So we’ve been locked in?

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.850
There’s a highly dense A.M.F.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.070
Mana can’t be gathered.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.040
Transmissions won’t get through, either.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:46.830
We’ve been had.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.370
Sette, this is your first battle.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.350
There’s no need for worry.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.220
I wasn’t born late for no reason.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.620
Execute I.S.

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.030
<b>Slaughter Arms</b>

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:04.420
<b>Ride Impulse</b>

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.040
Action!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.950
The gas isn’t a lethal type, but rather a paralyzing one.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:19.610
I’m sending the defense data to you now.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.860
The jamming’s strong.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.000
Long Arch!

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:33.060
The situation outside has stopped for the time being,
but the situation inside is unknown.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.380
Lieutenant, we’ll head inside.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.090
We have to rescue Nanoha and everyone else.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.480
There are aerial units heading toward HQ.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.640
They’re fast!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.580
Ranks are estimated to be S+.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:51.670
Rein!

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:52.840
Righty-o!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.510
Rein and I will head up.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.550
These guys will handle Surface HQ.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:01.740
I’ll leave these to you as well.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.910
Make sure it gets to them.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.640
Ma’am!

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.820
Rein, it’s Unison time!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:08.840
Yes indeedy!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.440
<b>Unison in!</b>

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.380
Please calm down!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.180
Everything is okay over here.

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.610
There’s no need to worry!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:46.030
The bulkheads to the meeting room
and the emergency exits are all completely sealed.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.030
There’s no way to contact our allies, either.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.400
The elevator’s down as well.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.250
There’s no way to get in contact with those trapped inside, either.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:59.090
In any event, we can’t just sit here.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:04.550
It might get kind of messy, but want to come with me, Fate?

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.030
Of course.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.870
Oh yeah, this should do.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.020
We haven’t done this since
the G.A.S. Training Course.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:20.710
It sure helps to do a lot of different types of training.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.130
You’re right.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:25.400
Orders were given on how to move if an emergency occurs.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:30.080
Our goal is to meet up at the designated location in the underground passageways, the Rotary Hall.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:30.930
On it.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.210
This is the Bureau.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:43.050
Permission for your flight has not been granted,
and your I.F.F. is not recognized.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:44.970
This voice is...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.630
Please stop immediately.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:50.600
If you proceed any further, we will intercept.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:53.800
You ass!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:55.770
<b>Blazing Spheres</b>

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.850
Physical shots?

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:04.220
<b>Giant Hammer</b>

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:11.360
We missed. Their counterattack and defenses blocked it.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.280
But the damage made it through.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:15.100
Let’s go and smash them up.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:29.300
Dammit.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.590
They hit us as hard as they could.

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:35.050
Sorry, Agito. You saved me.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.100
Not at all.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.680
They’re a Unison-type.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:41.050
The same as us, eh?

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:46.010
This is Lieutenant Vita
of the Bureau’s Riot Force 6 Stars Squad.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.410
Zest.

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:56.740
Mach Caliber!

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:58.190
Protection

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:12.490
Subaru!

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:21.250
Nove, you didn’t forget anything we had to do?

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:25.020
Shut up, I didn’t forget anything.

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:29.810
Our capture targets were those three. We are to bring all of them back alive.

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:34.430
Even if they are old, can a Type-0 really be taken down this easily?

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:37.040
Combat cyborgs.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.040
We’re all done here, right?

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:46.170
We’ll head to the next one.

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:53.010
Yes, young lady, the place where the unconfirmed Relic
and the Vessel of the Holy King is believed to be held.

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.390
Riot Force 6.

00:22:57.350 --> 00:23:02.470
This can’t be! Two large energy signatures
approaching us at high speed!

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:05.060
Standby unit, prepare to intercept.

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:07.440
Send a notice for support to the nearby units.

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:08.150
Yes, sir!

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:11.070
All hands, highest alert status.

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:15.990
Support staff, please hurry with your evacuation.

00:25:18.740 --> 00:25:20.320
Things I wanted to protect,

00:25:20.320 --> 00:25:21.820
and things I had to protect.

00:25:21.820 --> 00:25:25.350
Things that are starting to crack, and things that will disappear.

00:25:34.040 --> 00:25:35.490
Take off!
